# Production build configuration (used by `vite build`).
#
# Production serves the front end from moon-dev.seatide.net and the forum API
# from api.seatide.net, so API requests are cross-origin. The value includes
# the `/forum-v1` prefix because `API_BASE` is the API root
# (see src/lib/constants.ts).
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.seatide.net/forum-v1